    "text": "**Frame-by-frame animation:** players on the court are now drawn side-on pixel athletes with their own skin, hair, beard, headwear, kit and number. They have run cycles, standing and on-the-move dribbles, jump shots (gather, rise, set, release, follow-through, landing), layups with the knee drive, dunks that hang on the rim, free throws, chest passes, defensive slides, contests, rebounds, screens and celebrations."
