    "head": "League Hunt blind spins",
    "text": "**League Hunt blind spins:** ratings and stats are hidden when you spin. You see the player, his season, his team and that year's awards, then the cards flip over to show what you took and what you passed on. Your picks earn a **draft grade**, and your best one is kept."
